{"id":"b95e7093b0f57f47","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections.md","title":"Theorem II.5 A Sheaf Is Recovered from Its Germ Sections","display":"Theorem II.5 A Sheaf Is Recovered from Its Germ Sections","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections","aliases":["14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections"],"display":"Theorem II.5 A Sheaf Is Recovered from Its Germ Sections","depends_on":["[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","[[14-df-etale-space-of-germs]]","[[14-thm-germ-charts-and-open-sections]]","[[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]]","[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]"],"source_location":"II.5 Theorem 1, printed 85–86; DjVu 48–49","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem II.5 A Sheaf Is Recovered from Its Germ Sections"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"08a9469876bddf9f\" href=\"?note=08a9469876bddf9f\" title=\"14-df-etale-space-of-germs\">14-df-etale-space-of-germs</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f84b744ac7e877e9\" href=\"?note=f84b744ac7e877e9\" title=\"14-thm-germ-charts-and-open-sections\">14-thm-germ-charts-and-open-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9607e7b53e4ed265\" href=\"?note=9607e7b53e4ed265\" title=\"14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves\">14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.5 Theorem 1, printed 85–86; DjVu 48–49"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的预层；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_XP=\\Gamma_X(\\Lambda_XP)\">\\(a_XP=\\Gamma_X(\\Lambda_XP)\\)</span>。符号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"08a9469876bddf9f\" href=\"?note=08a9469876bddf9f\" title=\"14-df-etale-space-of-germs\">14-df-etale-space-of-germs</a>；分离性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9607e7b53e4ed265\" href=\"?note=9607e7b53e4ed265\" title=\"14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves\">14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSheaf}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Nat}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sep}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sep}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"9607e7b53e4ed265\" href=\"?note=9607e7b53e4ed265\" title=\"14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves\">14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves</a> 中的精确签名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\eta_{P,U}:P(U)\\to(a_XP)(U),\\qquad\\eta_{P,U}(s)=\\widehat s,\\qquad\\eta_P\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(P,a_XP).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\eta_{P,U}:P(U)\\to(a_XP)(U),\\qquad\\eta_{P,U}(s)=\\widehat s,\\qquad\\eta_P\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(P,a_XP).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sep}(P,X,\\tau)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall s,t\\in P(U)\\;(\\eta_{P,U}(s)=\\eta_{P,U}(t)\\Rightarrow s=t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sep}(P,X,\\tau)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall s,t\\in P(U)\\;(\\eta_{P,U}(s)=\\eta_{P,U}(t)\\Rightarrow s=t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(P,X,\\tau)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(\\eta_{P,U}:P(U)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}(a_XP)(U)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(P,X,\\tau)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(\\eta_{P,U}:P(U)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}(a_XP)(U)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\eta_P:=\\operatorname{TNat}_X\\left(P,a_XP,((s\\mapsto\\widehat s))_{U\\in\\tau}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\eta_P:=\\operatorname{TNat}_X\\left(P,a_XP,((s\\mapsto\\widehat s))_{U\\in\\tau}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat s=\\widehat t\">\\(\\widehat s=\\widehat t\\)</span> 等价于两者在每个点附近相等；分离性使全域相等。反过来，沿开覆盖相等自然导致所有茎相等，故分量单射推出分离性。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 是层，任意连续茎截面在局部是某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{s_i}\">\\(\\widehat{s_i}\\)</span>；局部图性质与分离性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i\">\\(s_i\\)</span> 在交上相等，层的拼接给出全局原像。若所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 为双射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 与已经是层的截面预层同构，因而是层。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-etale-space-of-germs","status":"resolved","id":"08a9469876bddf9f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-etale-space-of-germs]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-germ-charts-and-open-sections","status":"resolved","id":"f84b744ac7e877e9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-germ-charts-and-open-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves","status":"resolved","id":"9607e7b53e4ed265","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $P$ 为 $X$ 上的预层；$a_XP=\\Gamma_X(\\Lambda_XP)$。符号见 [[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]、[[14-df-etale-space-of-germs]]；分离性见 [[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-etale-space-of-germs","status":"resolved","id":"08a9469876bddf9f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $P$ 为 $X$ 上的预层；$a_XP=\\Gamma_X(\\Lambda_XP)$。符号见 [[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]、[[14-df-etale-space-of-germs]]；分离性见 [[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves","status":"resolved","id":"9607e7b53e4ed265","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $P$ 为 $X$ 上的预层；$a_XP=\\Gamma_X(\\Lambda_XP)$。符号见 [[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]、[[14-df-etale-space-of-germs]]；分离性见 [[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSheaf}$ 沿用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Nat}$ 沿用 [[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Sep}$ 沿用 [[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]] 中的精确签名。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSheaf}$ 沿用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Nat}$ 沿用 [[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Sep}$ 沿用 [[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]] 中的精确签名。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves","status":"resolved","id":"9607e7b53e4ed265","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsSheaf}$ 沿用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Nat}$ 沿用 [[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Sep}$ 沿用 [[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]] 中的精确签名。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"a_XP=\\Gamma_X(\\Lambda_XP)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Nat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sep}","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_{P,U}:P(U)\\to(a_XP)(U),\\qquad\\eta_{P,U}(s)=\\widehat s,\\qquad\\eta_P\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(P,a_XP).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sep}(P,X,\\tau)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;\\forall s,t\\in P(U)\\;(\\eta_{P,U}(s)=\\eta_{P,U}(t)\\Rightarrow s=t).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSheaf}(P,X,\\tau)\\iff\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(\\eta_{P,U}:P(U)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}(a_XP)(U)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\eta_P:=\\operatorname{TNat}_X\\left(P,a_XP,((s\\mapsto\\widehat s))_{U\\in\\tau}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat s=\\widehat t","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat{s_i}","display":false},{"tex":"s_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":2275,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections|Theorem II.5 A Sheaf Is Recovered from Its Germ Sections]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-77","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-s